WEBVTT

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:13.540
Stand strong, Ink Knight.
Never yield.

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:22.140
Only all six mediums forged into one unified tool
can halt the grid.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:29.020
I'll stitch this split in no time.
Threads of gold, hold tight.

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:31.260
Together we are unbroken.

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:37.460
Only those who honor the Maker's hand
may cross this threshold.
